      "Grade 8 · Listening and speaking: listens to a text read aloud and takes part in a dialogue based on it, using discourse markers to sustain dialogue and assigning roles, and delivers an oral such as an interview, a questionnaire, a report or a group discussion, researching the topic, organising material coherently, supporting it with examples and preparing an effective introduction and conclusion",
