      "Grade 9 · Listening and speaking: listens to a newspaper report and delivers an oral presentation of the report, attending to structure, features, language use, tone, register, body language, introduction and conclusion, and answers listening comprehension by reacting critically to a variety of texts, listening for specific information and answering questions",
