      "Grade 9 · Term 3 Music: Performing and creating music - Breathing and technical exercises suitable for the instrument or voice Group or solo performances from the appropriate repertoire of Western/African/Indian/popular musical styles: - Choral works - Group instrumental works - Solo vocal works - Solo instrumental works Adding music to words of a poem (four lines)",
